<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>SAGE PHP/JS example</title><style>body{font:16px system-ui;max-width:52rem;margin:2rem auto;padding:0 1rem}label{display:block;margin:.8rem 0}button{padding:.6rem 1rem}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f2f4f6;padding:1rem}</style></head><body><h1>SAGE PHP/JavaScript example</h1><p>Choose a PNG, JPEG, or WebP image. The server reads prior evidence, performs the selected operation, appends the example participant, and verifies the result.</p><form id="form"><label>Image <input name="image" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" required></label><label>Participant ID <input name="participant_id" value="SAGE.TEST.PHP" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9._~-]{1,64}" required></label><label>Operation note <input name="ext_data_1" value="browser-demo"></label><label>Image operation <select name="operation"><option value="none">No pixel change</option><option value="resize_50">Resize to 50%</option><option value="brightness_10">Increase brightness</option></select></label><button>Process image</button></form><pre id="result" aria-live="polite">Waiting for an image.</pre><a id="download" hidden>Download processed image</a><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>
